# TUNINGS 13 / six expressions, three growth populations and three cell voices.
# Growth order supplies another rhythm; it does not consume the sequence grid.
# Cells repeat through the longer canopy arc instead of ending after 2.4 s.
# h gates are independent per voice. Replace any local u with a Scale desk option.
